PCIE,pcie_cfg_wr_rd_test,TestRepo/pcie/pcie_cfg_wr_rd_test,"Perform PCIe link training (DM0/DM1 as RC or EP via build-time defines), program coherency control and memory base, configure BARs, and validate config space reads/writes including handshake at 0xE6004100.",test_case,"link_training_*(); set_data() field programming; mem_base_program_dm*_x4(); read/write pcie_slv*_reg(); poll SII status; non_secure_prot_nic(); wait_on();","Test passes if handshake register 0xE6004100 reaches 0x12345678 and finish(0) is called with no errors.","program.c","https://github.com/titusbspgit/PSVValidation/tree/main/TestRepo/pcie/pcie_cfg_wr_rd_test"